{%- comment -%}
  LINUX · Order confirmation · Arabic (العربية)
  Shopify admin → Settings → Notifications → Customer notifications → Order confirmation
  ARABIC copy. If English is your store's default language: open the notification, click "Localize" (Translate & Adapt), pick Arabic and paste this into the email body translation. If Arabic is the default, use "Edit code" instead (see README).
  Email subject: طلبك {{ name }} اتأكد. شكراً ليك!
  Generated by linux-store/notifications/dev/build.mjs from notifications/src. Edit the source, then rebuild.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} ===== EDIT ME (optional) =====
  whatsapp_number: digits only, international format (Egypt: 20 + the mobile number without its leading 0).
    Pre-filled with the storefront's number (Theme settings → Brand & social). Set it to '' to hide the WhatsApp button.
  logo_url: leave '' to use the logo uploaded in Settings → Notifications → Customize email templates.
    To show a different logo only in these emails, paste the full https:// address of a PNG (for example from Content → Files).
  store_url: Arabic links open the /ar storefront. If Arabic is your store's DEFAULT language, change the line below to: assign store_url = shop.url
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign whatsapp_number = '201110351549' -%}
{%- assign logo_url = '' -%}
{%- assign store_url = shop.url | append: '/ar' -%}
{%- assign lx_wa = whatsapp_number | remove: '+' | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' -%}
{%- assign lx_logo = logo_url | default: shop.email_logo_url -%}
{%- assign lx_logo_w = shop.email_logo_width | default: 140 -%}
{%- assign lx_first_name = customer.first_name | default: shipping_address.first_name | default: billing_address.first_name | strip -%}
{%- assign lx_probe = 'ا,ب,ت,ث,ج,ح,خ,د,ذ,ر,ز,س,ش,ص,ض,ط,ظ,ع,غ,ف,ق,ك,ل,م,ن,ه,و,ي,ى,ة,ء,أ,إ,آ,ؤ,ئ' | split: ',' -%}
{%- assign lx_context = 'order' -%}
{%- assign lx_step = 1 -%}
{%- assign lx_is_custom = false -%}
{%- for lx_l in line_items -%}{%- for p in lx_l.properties -%}{%- if p.first == 'Garment' or p.first == 'Method' -%}{%- assign lx_is_custom = true -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- endfor -%}
